    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [X] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version\n\n### Module(s)\n\nPick\n\n### Description\n\nCmdheight is not restored when entering and exiting Mini.Pick resume.\r\n\r\n \n\n### Neovim version\n\nNVIM v0.10.0-dev+2324-g4948fa42e\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. `nvim -nu minimal.lua`\r\n2. `set cmdheight=0`\r\n3. `lua MiniPick.builtin.files()`\r\n4. close\r\n5. `lua MiniPick.builtin.resume()`\r\n6. close\r\n\r\n\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nRestore cmdheight when exiting \"resume\"\n\n### Actual behavior\n\n[Screencast from 2024-02-13 12-48-08.webm](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/91024200/b0034639-ba4e-4946-9af0-d1023679610f)\r\n",
